U|                         Too perfect. Too beautiful, too 
U|                         talented, too sophisticated, too 
U|                         everything -- but what I want.
O|
C|                                     STELLA
P|                              (Cautiously)
U|                         Is what you want something you can 
U|                         discuss?
O|
N|               Jeff gives an exasperated look.
O|
C|                                     JEFF
U|                         It's very simple. She belongs in 
U|                         that rarefied atmosphere of Park 
U|                         Avenue, expensive restaurants, and 
