U|                         together -- wham like two taxies on 
U|                         Broadway. Not sit around studying 
U|                         each other like specimens in at 
U|                         bottle.
O|
C|                                     JEFF
U|                         There's an intelligent way to approach 
U|                         marriage.
O|
C|                                     STELLA
P|                              (Scoffing)
U|                         Intelligence! Nothing has caused the 
U|                         human race more trouble. Modern 
U|                         marriage!
O|
N|               Jeff swings his chair back to look at her.
O|
C|                                     JEFF
U|                         We've progressed emotionally in --
O|
C|                                     STELLA
P|                              (Interrupting)
U|                         Baloney! Once it was see somebody, 
U|                         get excited, get married -- Now, 
U|                         it's read books, fence with four 
U|                         syllable words, psychoanalyze each 
U|                         other until you can't tell a petting 
U|                         party from a civil service exam
O|
C|                                     JEFF
U|                         People have different emotional levels 
U|                         that --
O|
C|                                     STELLA
P|                              (Interrupting again)
U|                         Ask for trouble and you get it. Why 
