O|
T|               FADE IN:
O|
S,G|               EXT. NEIGHBORHOOD - NIGHT - SUNSET - LONG SHOT
O|
N,G|               The CAMERA makes a short sweep around the neighborhood showing 
N|               that some of the rooms are now with their lights on.
O|
