N,G|               coming nearer and nearer to the CAMERA to kiss Jeff. The 
N|               face is more or less in shadow, a faint light coming onto 
N|               the profile from the window. It moves down until the lips 
N,G|               move out of her bottom of her screen, and just the remain 
N,G|               for fill the screen.
O|
S,G|               INT. JEFF'S APARTMENT - SUNSET - CLOSEUP
O|
